{"id":"10bfe2126b30365e","group":"93","path":"93/93-df-powers.md","title":"Powers","display":"df-powers — Powers","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-df-powers","aliases":["93-df-powers"],"display":"df-powers — Powers","depends_on":["[[93-df-product]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-df-powers"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-df-powers</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-powers — Powers"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"260c377f5e1dcfdf\" href=\"?note=260c377f5e1dcfdf\" title=\"93-df-product\">93-df-product</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathfrak A)\">\\(\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathfrak A)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span> is a set.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ConstAlgFam}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,I)\">\\(\\operatorname{ConstAlgFam}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,I)\\)</span> is the constant indexed algebra family defined here; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prod}_{93}(-;I,\\tau)\">\\(\\mathrm{Prod}_{93}(-;I,\\tau)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CoordProj}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{CoordProj}_{93}\\)</span> are the product and coordinate-projection constructors of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"260c377f5e1dcfdf\" href=\"?note=260c377f5e1dcfdf\" title=\"93-df-product\">93-df-product</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PowAlg}_{93}(-,-;\\tau)\">\\(\\mathrm{PowAlg}_{93}(-,-;\\tau)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PowProj}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{PowProj}_{93}\\)</span> are the power-algebra and its coordinate-projection constructors defined here.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}powers}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{ConstAlgFam}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,I)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle i,\\mathfrak A\\rangle:i\\in I\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}powers}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{ConstAlgFam}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,I)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle i,\\mathfrak A\\rangle:i\\in I\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}powers}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{PowAlg}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,I;\\tau)=\\mathfrak A^{I,\\tau}\n\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Prod}_{93}\\bigl(\n\\operatorname{ConstAlgFam}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,I);I,\\tau\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}powers}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{PowAlg}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,I;\\tau)=\\mathfrak A^{I,\\tau}\n\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Prod}_{93}\\bigl(\n\\operatorname{ConstAlgFam}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,I);I,\\tau\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}powers}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{PowProj}_{93}(i;\\mathfrak A,I)\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{CoordProj}_{93}\\bigl(\ni;\\operatorname{ConstAlgFam}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,I),I\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}powers}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{PowProj}_{93}(i;\\mathfrak A,I)\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{CoordProj}_{93}\\bigl(\ni;\\operatorname{ConstAlgFam}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,I),I\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}powers}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathfrak A)\\land I\\in V\\to\n\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathrm{PowAlg}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,I;\\tau))\n\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;\\bigl(\n\\operatorname{PowProj}_{93}(i;\\mathfrak A,I):\n|\\mathrm{PowAlg}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,I;\\tau)|\\to|\\mathfrak A|\\bigr)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}powers}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathfrak A)\\land I\\in V\\to\n\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathrm{PowAlg}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,I;\\tau))\n\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;\\bigl(\n\\operatorname{PowProj}_{93}(i;\\mathfrak A,I):\n|\\mathrm{PowAlg}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,I;\\tau)|\\to|\\mathfrak A|\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The constant factor family and every coordinate projection are explicit graphs with domain data <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span>. Coordinatewise operations and the empty-index case are inherited from the indexed product definition; the typing theorem also states that the exponent is a set.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-product","status":"resolved","id":"260c377f5e1dcfdf","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-product]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-product","status":"resolved","id":"260c377f5e1dcfdf","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{ConstAlgFam}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,I)$ is the constant indexed algebra family defined here; $\\mathrm{Prod}_{93}(-;I,\\tau)$ and $\\operatorname{CoordProj}_{93}$ are the product and coordinate-projection constructors of [[93-df-product]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathfrak A)","display":false},{"tex":"I","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ConstAlgFam}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,I)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Prod}_{93}(-;I,\\tau)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{CoordProj}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PowAlg}_{93}(-,-;\\tau)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{PowProj}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}powers}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{ConstAlgFam}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,I)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle i,\\mathfrak A\\rangle:i\\in I\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}powers}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{PowAlg}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,I;\\tau)=\\mathfrak A^{I,\\tau}\n\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Prod}_{93}\\bigl(\n\\operatorname{ConstAlgFam}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,I);I,\\tau\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}powers}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{PowProj}_{93}(i;\\mathfrak A,I)\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{CoordProj}_{93}\\bigl(\ni;\\operatorname{ConstAlgFam}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,I),I\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}powers}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathfrak A)\\land I\\in V\\to\n\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathrm{PowAlg}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,I;\\tau))\n\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;\\bigl(\n\\operatorname{PowProj}_{93}(i;\\mathfrak A,I):\n|\\mathrm{PowAlg}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,I;\\tau)|\\to|\\mathfrak A|\\bigr)\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"I","display":false}],"bytes":1782,"backlinks":[{"id":"52c2a3857da7da70","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"d97e4cff9496e188","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PowAlg}_{93}$ is the direct-power constructor of [[93-df-powers]]."},{"id":"5db3fa00f537080b","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PowAlg}_{93}$ and $\\mathrm{Iso}_{93}$ are the predicates/constructors of [[93-df-powers]] and [[93-df-isomorphism]]."},{"id":"8fc1b7ff910f430e","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\tau_{\\mathsf{BA}}$ is the Boolean similarity type of [[93-df-boolalg]], and $\\mathrm{PowAlg}_{93}$ and $\\operatorname{PowProj}_{93}$ are the power and explicit coordinate-projection constructors of [[93-df-powers]]."},{"id":"1d8f97525e56da1b","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Subalg}_{93}$ and $\\mathrm{PowAlg}_{93}$ have the signatures fixed in [[93-df-subalgebra]] and [[93-df-powers]]."},{"id":"4b566884cfea35b9","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"8812becc0adfe44f","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{ConstAlgFam}_{93}(\\mathbf A,I)$ is the constant algebra family of [[93-df-powers]]; $\\mathrm{Const}_{93}(a;\\mathbf A,I)$ and $\\delta^{\\tau}_{\\mathbf A,\\mathcal U,I}$ are defined below."},{"id":"57abb955e28f83aa","anchor":"ref-35","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[93-df-powers]]"}],"outgoing":["260c377f5e1dcfdf"]}